# notify-owners.conf — which machine's arm holder OWNS an alert from a source (bin/notify/send.sh, the owner road).
#
# Copy to <home>/config/notify-owners.conf. One rule per line: <source> <machine>.
#   self   the machine named in the alert line (the default when no rule matches)
#   off    no owner road for this source: the raw line goes to the chat at once
#   *      the rule for every source not named above it
# When the owner's arm does not answer, the heart's arm holder (fleet.json "heart") takes the alert.
#
# cron   self
# ward   self
# garmr  host-a
# trello off
*        self
